  portrait: {fileID: 0}
  journalLore: 'Settlers of the clearing before you, taken by the mist and not let go. Something of who they were is left: their names, their gear, the way they swung a sword. The rest is hunger for the flame you keep.'
  journalAdvice: 'It fights as you do: a cut, a second, a finishing blow. Read the wind-up, step out of the chain, and strike when the finisher misses. Wounded, it runs into the mist and comes back stronger. Fire was always their fear.'
  journalHabitat: Wherever the keeper walks
